==English==
{{wikipedia|Sperm Whale}}
[[File:Mother_and_baby_sperm_whale.jpg|thumb|Mother and calf sperm whales.]]

===Etymology===
Clipping of {{m|en|spermaceti whale}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[whale]] (''[[Physeter catodon]]'', syn. ''[[Physeter macrocephalus]]''), the [[largest]] of the [[toothed]] [[whales]].
# Any whale in the superfamily {{taxlink|Physeteroidea|superfamily|ver=180702}}, which also includes the small whales of genus ''[[Kogia]]''.

====Synonyms====
* {{l|en|cachalot}}
* {{vern|common cachalot}}

====Derived terms====
* [[dwarf sperm whale]]
* {{l|en|pygmy sperm whale}}
* {{vern|sperm-whale porpoise}}

